{"id":"word:hebrew:H4639","type":"word","title":"מַעֲשֶׂה","subtitle":"H4639 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"an action (good or bad); generally, a transaction ; abstractly, activity ; by implication, a product (specifically, a poem ) or (generally) property","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מַעֲשֶׂה (H4639) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 235 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מַעֲשֶׂה (maʻăseh) means an action (good or bad); generally, a transaction ; abstractly, activity ; by implication, a product (specifically, a poem ) or (generally) property First listed occurrence: 1Chr 9 31."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מַעֲשֶׂה","transliteration":"maʻăseh","pronunciation":"mah-as-eh'","strong":"H4639","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4639","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מַעֲשֵׂ֣ה","מַעֲשֵׂ֥ה","מַעֲשֵׂ֖ה","כְּ/מַעֲשֵׂ֣ה","מַעֲשֵׂ֣י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc",85],["HR/Ncmsc",22],["HNcmpc/Sp2ms",13],["HTd/Ncmsa",12],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",11],["HC/Ncmsc",10],["HNcmsa",10],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",9],["HNcmpc",8],["HNcmpc/Sp3mp",8]]},"definitions":{"short":"an action (good or bad); generally, a transaction ; abstractly, activity ; by implication, a product (specifically, a poem ) or (generally) property","usage":"act, art, bakemeat, business, deed, do(-ing), labor, thing made, ware of making, occupation, thing offered, operation, possession, × well, (handy-, needle-, net-) work(ing, -manship), wrought.","full":"H4639. maaseh מַעֲשֶׂה 233 noun masculine Gen 20:9 deed, work ; — absolute ׳מ 44:15 +, construct מַעֲשֵׂה Isa 5:12 +; suffix מַעֲשֵׂהוּ Judg 13:12 +, etc.; plural מַעֲשִׂים Gen 20:9 +; construct מַעֲשֵׂי Jer 1:16 +; suffix מַעֲשָׂיו 1Sam 19:4 (or singular, so Dr) +, etc.; — often accusative of congnate meaning with verb with עשׂה ; — 1. a. -1 deed, thing done by man Num 16:28 (JE), 1Kin 13:11 ; Isa 26:12 ; &#8212; b. -1 work, labour , husbandry Exod 23:16 (E), Gen 5:29 (J), Judg 19:16 , c. deed(s), work(s) of ׳י , especially in deliverance and in judgment, Judg 2:7 , 10 ; Josh 24:31 (D), Psa 33:4 21 t., + ׳מ יָדָיו etc. Isa 5:12 ; Psa 28:5 ; 92:5 4 t.; ׳מ הָאֱלֹהִים in General Eccl 7:13 ; 8:17 ; 11:5 ; compare 3:11 . 2. a. -1 work, thing made , by man, ׳מ אֹפֶה b. work (made by) God Exod 32:16 (E); especially (poetry and late), of created things, Psa 103:22 ; 104:24 4 t. Psalms; ׳מ אֶצְבְּעֹתֶיךָ 8:4 , ׳מ יָרֶיךָ 102:26 (both of heavens), compare 19:2 (heavenly bodies), 8:7 (animals); of man Job 14:15 ; 34:19 , compare מַעֲשֵׂהוּ כָּלאַֿנְשֵׁי לָדַעַת 37:7 (but read probably ᵑ9 אנשׁים Ol Di and others); of nation Isa 19:25 ; 60:21 ; 64:7 ; of weights Prov 16:11 (but read perhaps הַמֶּלֶךְ ) for ׳י Gr Toy). c. product of olive-tree, ׳מ זַיִת Hab 3:17 ; figurative product of righteousness Isa 32:17 .","rootNote":"from 6213 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 9 31","keyReferences":["1Chr 9 31","1Chr 23 28","1Kgs 7 8","1Kgs 7 17","1Kgs 7 17","1Kgs 7 19","1Kgs 7 22","1Kgs 7 26"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":235,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 9 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַעֲשֵׂ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מַֽעֲשֵׂ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כַּ/מַּֽעֲשֶׂ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 17","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַעֲשֵׂ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 17","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מַעֲשֵׂ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":19,"en